Design:
- `counter.js`: creates a store with in-memory Map of deltas, flush loop every 500ms or when any counter > 100, single transaction upsert into sqlite, zero memory only after commit.
- Flush failure simulation: mock statement to throw once; retry must not lose/double-count. So on failure, don't zero memory; retry next tick.
- Reads: DB value + pending memory = exact.

